<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Coming Soon - English Learning Hub</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            background: #252525;
            border: 2px solid #444;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            max-width: 450px;
            width: 90%;
            position: relative;
        }

        .sparkle {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            animation: bounce 1.5s infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #ffcc00;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        p {
            color: #cccccc;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        /* Coming Soon Animation */
        .coming-soon-box {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff6b6b, #ffcc00, #00ffcc);
            background-size: 200% 200%;
            animation: gradientMove 3s ease infinite;
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 204, 0, 0.4);
        }

        .coming-soon-text {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            animation: pulse 1s infinite alternate;
        }

        /* Keyframes for animations */
        @keyframes gradientMove {
            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            100% { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #777777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="sparkle">✨🚀✨</div>
        <h1>New Lessons Are On The Way!</h1>
        <p>हामी तपाईंको लागि अझै धेरै उत्कृष्ट र रमाइलो पाठहरू (Lessons) तयार गर्दैछौं। छिट्टै यहाँ नयाँ कन्टेन्ट थपिनेछ!</p>
        
        <div class="coming-soon-box">
            <div class="coming-soon-text">Coming Soon ❣️❣️❣️</div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-note">Stay tuned for amazing updates!</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
